{"id":2315,"date":"2024-09-19T12:34:35","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:34:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2315"},"modified":"2025-10-02T13:43:49","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T13:43:49","slug":"cardboard-burger-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-burger-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Burger Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Custom Burger Packaging for Restaurants and Food Trucks<\/h2>\n<p>Cardboard burger boxes are essential for keeping burgers fresh, safe, and ready for delivery or takeaway. At Shop Cardboard Boxes, we offer <strong>custom cardboard burger boxes<\/strong> at wholesale prices. Whether you&#8217;re a fast-food chain, food truck, or independent restaurant, our burger packaging boxes help you maintain presentation, quality, and hygiene during service.<\/p>\n<p>You can choose from plain Kraft burger boxes or full-color printed packaging to match your branding. Our burger boxes come in various sizes and styles, with or without lids. All orders include fast turnaround, custom options, and high-quality materials.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"319\">High-Quality Cardboard Burger Boxes for Food Brands<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"371\"><strong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"371\">Built for Heat, Freshness, and Secure Transport<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"659\">We manufacture cardboard burger boxes with lids that are <strong data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"450\">grease-resistant<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"463\">durable<\/strong>, and designed to handle both <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"514\">hot and cold food<\/strong>. Whether it&#8217;s a freshly grilled burger or a chilled sandwich, these boxes help <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"618\">maintain temperature<\/strong> and <strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"641\">prevent spills<\/strong> during transport.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"876\">Made from <strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"709\">food-grade or recyclable cardboard<\/strong>, they\u2019re a practical choice for eco-conscious food businesses. You can also choose custom-printed options to feature your <strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"875\">logo, branding, or promotional messages<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"925\">Designed for Dine-In, Takeaway, and Delivery<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"961\">Our burger boxes are suitable for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<li data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"988\">\n<p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"988\">Fast food restaurants<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1017\">\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1017\">Food trucks and trailers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1046\">\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1046\">Burger stands and kiosks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1077\">\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1077\">Sports arenas and stadiums<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1113\">Ghost kitchens and virtual brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1346\">The design is compact yet sturdy. Choose from <strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1199\">tuck-top, hinged lid, or clamshell<\/strong> styles based on your packaging preferences. Each box locks securely to avoid leaks and helps preserve food quality during <strong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1345\">takeout or delivery<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1495\">You can request <strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1395\">plain brown Kraft cardboard<\/strong> for a simple look or opt for <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1448\">full-color printing<\/strong> to grab attention and reinforce your branding.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1550\">Cardboard Burger Boxes Wholesale Options Available<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1779\">We offer <strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1597\">wholesale cardboard burger boxes<\/strong> in bulk quantities with flexible MOQs. Whether you&#8217;re running a chain of outlets or a single burger joint, we can accommodate your needs with fast turnaround and consistent quality.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"2134\">Looking to expand your food packaging range? These burger boxes work great when paired with <strong data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1959\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-snack-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1957\">Cardboard Snack Boxes<\/a><\/strong> \u2014 ideal for fries, onion rings, nuggets, and more. Keeping your brand consistent across burger and snack packaging creates a cohesive look for dine-in trays or delivery kits.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2171\">Why Choose Our Burger Packaging?<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2473\">\n<li data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2221\">\n<p data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2221\"><strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2219\">Grease-proof and heat-resistant material<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2263\">\n<p data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2263\"><strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2251\">Custom sizes and shapes<\/strong> available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2299\">\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2299\"><strong data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2297\">Food-safe inks and coatings<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2336\">\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2336\"><strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2334\">Tear and moisture resistance<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2388\">\n<p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2388\"><strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2386\">Available in brown Kraft or white cardboard<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2439\">\n<p data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2439\"><strong data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2426\">Die-cut vents for steam control<\/strong> (optional)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2473\">\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2473\"><strong data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2473\">Stackable and easy to store<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2622\">Whether you&#8217;re serving burgers in a bustling kitchen or delivering meals across town, our boxes help present your food professionally and securely.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Burger Boxes Wholesale Sizes and Applications<\/h2>\n<h3>Most Popular Burger Box Dimensions<\/h3>\n<p>We provide standard and custom sizes based on the type and quantity of food being packed. Here\u2019s a breakdown of common sizes:<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainD